{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>In the path of righteousness I walk</b> — The words of Wisdom are like the words of a wise man. The meaning: for whoever desires wisdom must conduct himself in this path. And he said, <b>in the midst of the paths of justice</b> — lest one turn right or left from the middle path."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:27.656640597Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}